  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.0",
  "name": "cml-tts",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tDataset Card for CML-TTS\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tDataset Summary\n\t\n\nCML-TTS is a recursive acronym for CML-Multi-Lingual-TTS, a Text-to-Speech (TTS) dataset developed at the Center of Excellence in Artificial Intelligence (CEIA) of the Federal University of Goias (UFG).\nCML-TTS is a dataset comprising audiobooks sourced from the public domain books of Project Gutenberg, read by volunteers from the LibriVox project. The dataset includes recordings in Dutch, German, French, Italian, Polish\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/ylacombe/cml-tts.",
  "alternateName": [
    "ylacombe/cml-tts",
    "CML-TTS"
  ],
  "creator": {
    "@type": "Person",
    "name": "Yoach Lacombe",
    "url": "https://huggingface.co/ylacombe"
  },
